Package: lcos-settings
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, xfconf, desktop-file-utils, gtk-update-icon-cache, adwaita-icon-theme-legacy, pkexec, passwd, adduser
Description: LCOS Command Center, unified settings for LCOS
 LCOS Command Center is a GTK 3 settings window for the Lunduke Computer
 Operating System. It covers display, desktop, appearance, windows,
 notifications, removable media, accessibility, power, keyboard, mouse,
 sound, date and time, language, users, startup, and default software.
 Privileged changes go through pkexec. The section list uses the Adwaita
 Legacy icons.
